OL,3,ANigeria mourns 32 killed as military
OL,4,Aplane crashes into swamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's President Bola Tinubu has
OL,7,Fdeclared three days of national
OL,8,Fmourning after a military aircraft
OL,9,Fcrashed in southern Ondo State, killing
OL,10,F32 people.
OL,12,FAuthorities say the plane was on a
OL,13,Froutine mission from Benin City to
OL,14,FLagos when it came down in a swamp near
OL,15,Fa naval base on Monday morning. After
OL,16,Freaching the site, the aircraft was
OL,17,Ffound to be submerged under water,
OL,18,Fofficials said.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
