OL,3,ANigeria mourns 32 killed as military
OL,4,Aplane crashes into swamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident told the BBC that clothes
OL,7,Fand shoes had been found at the site.
OL,8,FSmoke could be seen rising from the
OL,9,Farea.
OL,11,FTinubu offered his deepest condolences
OL,12,Ffor the 25 passengers and seven crew
OL,13,Fmembers on board and has ordered a full
OL,14,Finvestigation.
